body: "GitHub report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1391\nReported version: 2026.10.4\n\nThe reporter needs source-workspace package acceptance without inherited PM_PATH while current none-mode requires an isolated or snapshot workspace. Existing source-tracker safety and trust rules must remain enforced; no new source bypass is assumed safe.\n\nThe complete public issue and its comments were read. This record is intake; the report is not independently reproduced or fixed yet. The completed predecessor pm-t05d8d remains shipped work and is not represented as an outstanding failure.\n\nAcceptance: Reproduce the nested disposable SDK-root failure and snapshot identity gap; Define an explicit source-tracker protection contract before permitting source execution without PM_PATH; Preserve PM_GLOBAL_PATH isolation and trust checks; Real package commands match direct CI results without mutating the source tracker."
